# Normalize line endings in the repo to LF.
# eol=lf is MANDATORY for golden test files: the generators always write
# "\n" regardless of platform, and GitHub's Windows runner images default
# to core.autocrlf=true — without eol=lf, checkout converts goldens to
# CRLF and every golden comparison fails on windows-latest.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets (never touch)
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.phar binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.node binary
